<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia GDP up 0.33 pct in Q2, up 1.78 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia GDP up 0.33 pct in Q2, up 1.78 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>					  Q2 96    Q1 96   Q2 95</p>
<p>    Change on previous quarter  +0.33    +1.18   +0.05</p>
<p>    Change on corresponding     +1.78    +1.50   +2.72</p>
<p>quarter of previous year</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
